(module Jack_3.5mm_Thonkiconn_WQP518MA_Numeric (layer F.Cu) (tedit 00000000)
  (descr "WQP518MA / PJ398SM / PJ301M-12 Thonkiconn switched mono 3.5 mm jack; numeric pads 1=TIP, 2=TIP_NORMAL, 3=SLEEVE; geometry derived from KiCad official WQP-PJ398SM footprint at commit 7ebfa6b23cc292a56f751b7b5f4a0e12eeef69dd; includes 3 mm barrel-relief NPTH")
